```text
PUBLIC SERVICES COMMIflEE
MINUTES
A meeting of the Public Services Committee was held on Tuesday, July 2, 2024, in Committee
Room 104 and via electronic meeting, starting at 12:00 p.m. Those in attendance were as follows:
COMMITTEE MEMBERS: Scoff Roybal, Chainnan, Pete Laybourn, Dr. Rinne, and Tom
Segrave.
AGENDA ITEMS
10.
ORDINANCE 3M READING - Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne changing the zoning classification from MUB Mixed-Use Business to CB
Community Business for land located northeast of the intersection ofCheyenne Street and
Ridge Road.
Mr. Segrave moved to approve on 3’’ and final reading, seconded by Dr. Rinne. Motion carried by
unanimous voice vote.
Connor White, Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report and committee
member Segrave commented on the item.
ii.
ORDINANCE _2M READING
— Amending Section 10.16.150, Parking Violation
Hearings and Appeal Procedures, of the Municipal Code of the City of Cheyenne,
Wyoming, modif5ing the procedures governing the Administrative Review of Parking
Citations, making conforming amendments and repealing an obsolete provision.
(SPONSORS - MIt JOHNSON AND MR. WHITE)
Mr. Segrave moved to approve on 2 reading, seconded by Mr. Layboum. Motion carried by
unanimous voice vote.
Captain David Janes, Police Department, provided a staffreport. Chairman Roybal and committee
member Laybouni commented on the item.
12.
ORDNANCE -2” READING - Creating Section 10.60.015, Paid On-Street Parking
Districts; Establishment, Administration, of the Municipal Code of the City of Cheyenne,
Wyoming, establishing the Paid On-Street Parking Districts Program and making
conforming amendments as specified. (SPONSORS
- MR. JOHNSON AND MR.
WHITE)
Dr. Rinne moved to approve on 2 reading, seconded by Mr. Segrave. Motion carried by
unanimous voice vote.
Captain David Janes, Police Department, provided a staff report and committee members
Laybourn, Rinne, and Segrave commented on the item. Public comment was made by Seth Lloyd.
```

